        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A legal expense insurance plan may be purchased by eligible employees. The legal plan provides employees and their eligible family members with coverage for basic legal services associated with preventive, domestic, consumer and defensive legal matters. The plan is employee-paid through payroll deductions.",
