        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Tax-Deferred 403(b) Plan – Participation in the UCRS Tax-Deferred 403(b) Plan is available to all University employees except students who normally work less than twenty (20) hours per week. The Plan provides the following investment options:",
