            "block_content": "b. Employees who participate in the UCRP will be eligible for the 2001-2002 Capital Accumulation Provision (CAP) accrual credit of 3% effective April 1, 2002, in accordance with the terms and conditions of the UCRP as approved by the Regents of the University of California.",
